        "Carry Ruto through the hole room to the five-way corridor. Take the left switch branch, defeat the flying Stingers with the Slingshot and obtain the Boomerang. Back outside, leave Ruto on the east weight switch and defeat the red tentacle. Clear the northwest blue tentacle, northeast bubble room for Compass, then central green tentacle.",
        "Drop through the newly clear northwest floor hole; collect both ledge/passage tokens. Throw Ruto onto the stone platform. Stun Bigocto, circle behind and stun its rear again before sword attacks; repeat until the lift rises.",
