      "steps": [
        "Spirit trial: bomb Beamos and collect all five Silver Crystals, using the ceiling target for the airborne one and moving Armos to clear the spike paths. Clear the next slugs for the Seed chest. Run a Bombchu through the wall’s high gap to its switch. Burn the ceiling cover with a Fire Arrow and reflect the shaft onto the sun left of the entrance; other suns summon Wallmasters. Light Arrow the core.",
        "Light trial: lift its entrance block. Lens and clear the invisible spider/Keese; open every small chest, including traps, and the enemy-clear rupee chest. In the next room play Lullaby for its rupee chest, then Lens the hidden left chest for the required key. Unlock, collect five boulder-room Silver Crystals with the central ceiling target and alcoves, Lens the false final passage and dispel the core.",
        "Fire trial: equip Goron Tunic and Hover Boots. Collect the nearby sinking-platform rupee, flamethrower rupee, one beneath the giant block, the far Torch Slug platform rupee, then the rupee reached by the thrown block. Longshot the exit and dispel the core.",
        "Water trial: defeat Freezards, open both first-room chests including the trap, bottle Blue Fire and thaw the exit. In the timed block room push the far block against its rock and into the hole; slide the other over the filled hole toward the ledge. Climb, thaw the red ice, hammer the rusty switch and enter to dispel the core.",
        "Forest trial: defeat Wolfos for the arrow chest; light the lower torch circle with Din’s Fire and the high door torch with Fire Arrow. In the fan room use Hover Boots and Time Blocks to gather the five Silver Crystals; the end-left switch reveals a post for the high rupee. Clear Beamos if it obstructs aiming, reach the door and dispel the final core.",
        "When all six Sages’ beams vanish, the central tower opens. Refill from the hidden room before ascending."
      ],
